        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-04T13:07:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>\n[quote=\"Happy Thoughts\"]\n</span></p><p><span>1. Bjarlspire has a card called DrurSkjyld Converter which is a tech card that, each battle phase, says, \"Make the Ship Panel's [weaponry] equal to half of its Ship Panel's [defense], rounded down.\" The question here is, is that a virtual calculation that overrides the actual tokens, or do the physical tokens get adjusted to match the calculation from the card's text (presumably even if the actual installed weaponry is a higher value)? Sub-question: Is this a permanent modification to the ship's weaponry value, or one that just lasts for the current battle phase?</span></p><p><span>\n[/quote]\n</span></p><p><span></span></p><p>In addition to the question above, does the&nbsp;<span>DrurSkjyld Converter just generate this effect once, or is it something that updates itself as play continues?</span></p><p><span>If the answer to my question above is \"yes it continues to adjust\" then I have a few questions to this question as well. &nbsp;I think couple of scenarios will explain what I want to know better.</span></p><p><span>1. &nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3. &nbsp;Later thanks to some boosts the shields get to 8. &nbsp;Does the attack then go to 4? &nbsp;And if so, during what phase is that adjustment made?<span></span></p><p><span>2. &nbsp;<span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;During a unfortunate fight it loses 2 shields. &nbsp;Does the attack go down to 2? &nbsp;And if so is this evaluated before or after finishing the attack?</span></span></p><p><span>3. &nbsp;<span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;Later a boost gives&nbsp;</span></span><span>Bjarlspire an additional attack token on the main card, giving a total of 4. &nbsp;Does the&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter then reduce this total back down to 3 because that is half the shields?<span></span></p><p><span>4. &nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;During a fight it gets a secondary boost increasing its defense to 8 for that fight only. &nbsp;Does the attack value get adjusted as well, and does it revert back at the end of the fight?</p><p>5. &nbsp;<span>Bjarlspire's on panel [Weaponry] is a 4 while thier defense is still a 6. &nbsp;If&nbsp;</span><span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played what happens to their defense?</span></p><p><span></span></p>",
