        "raw": "<p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">\n[quote=\"Happy Thoughts\"]\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">1. Bjarlspire has a card called DrurSkjyld Converter which is a tech card that, each battle phase, says, &quot;Make the Ship Panel&#39;s [weaponry] equal to half of its Ship Panel&#39;s [defense], rounded down.&quot; The question here is, is that a virtual calculation that overrides the actual tokens, or do the physical tokens get adjusted to match the calculation from the card&#39;s text (presumably even if the actual installed weaponry is a higher value)? Sub-question: Is this a permanent modification to the ship&#39;s weaponry value, or one that just lasts for the current battle phase?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">\n[/quote]\n</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\">In addition to the question above, does the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">DrurSkjyld Converter just generate this effect once, or is it something that updates itself as play continues?</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">If the answer to my question above is &quot;yes it continues to adjust&quot; then I have a few questions to this question as well. &nbsp;I think couple of scenarios will explain what I want to know better.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">1. &nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3. &nbsp;Later thanks to some boosts the shields get to 8. &nbsp;Does the attack then go to 4? &nbsp;And if so, during what phase is that adjustment made?<span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">2. &nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;During a unfortunate fight it loses 2 shields. &nbsp;Does the attack go down to 2? &nbsp;And if so is this evaluated before or after finishing the attack?</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">3. &nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;Later a boost gives&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in; background-color: white;\">Bjarlspire an additional attack token on the main card, giving a total of 4. &nbsp;Does the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">&nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter then reduce this total back down to 3 because that is half the shields?<span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">4. &nbsp;</span>DrurSkjyld Converter is played and&nbsp;[defense]&nbsp;is 6, giving them an&nbsp;[weaponry]&nbsp;value of 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;During a fight it gets a secondary boost increasing its defense to 8 for that fight only. &nbsp;Does the attack value get adjusted as well, and does it revert back at the end of the fight?</p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\">5. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\">Bjarlspire&#39;s on panel [Weaponry] is a 4 while thier defense is still a 6. &nbsp;If&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">DrurSkjyld Converter is played what happens to their defense?</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
