      {
        "id": 105544,
        "name": "FrostMist",
        "username": "FrostMist",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frostmist/{size}/1952_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-08T09:37:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Quick question that came up when we played - does attack tech still count? As in, if you have the DrurSkjyld Converter in play and some tech that gives +1 attack, and your base defence is 6 - do you get 3 or 4 attack total?</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:10.991Z",
