        "id": 105545,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-08T10:29:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It says it only changes the ships panel. So shield tech doesn't increase it, but weapon tech would as long as it doesn't add to the ship panel's weaponry total.</p><p>So Apt Countermeasures would increase the panel's shields and hence, eventually, the panel's wepaonry via DrurSkjyld Converter, as it increases the ship panel's shields, but DuraCycling Plating wouldn't. Likewise, Master Crafters could add to the ship panel's weaponry, but it would be overwritten by the Converter. If you'd installed the Colossal Pulse Cannon, however, this would be unaffected as it's not on the ship's panel.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:11.112Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
