        "raw": "<p>It says it only changes the ships panel. So shield tech doesn&#39;t increase it, but weapon tech would as long as it doesn&#39;t add to the ship panel&#39;s weaponry total.</p><p>So Apt Countermeasures would increase the panel&#39;s shields and hence, eventually, the panel&#39;s wepaonry via DrurSkjyld Converter, as it increases the ship panel&#39;s shields, but DuraCycling Plating wouldn&#39;t. Likewise, Master Crafters could add to the ship panel&#39;s weaponry, but it would be overwritten by the Converter. If you&#39;d installed the Colossal Pulse Cannon, however, this would be unaffected as it&#39;s not on the ship&#39;s panel.</p>",
